#: ../../operations.rst:1986
msgid ""
"The router in front of a cluster chooses a node for each client, and it "
"chooses again when a node joins or leaves. A client then reaches a node "
"that does not know it: its sticky server, its rate counters and its UDP "
"session are on another node. With ``forward`` in the mesh section the "
"nodes repair this themselves. Every client address has one owner among "
"the live nodes. A node that receives a new connection or a UDP client of "
"another owner hands it to that owner, and the owner serves it under the "
"client's own address."
msgstr ""

